DSH Remote (https://github.com/liguobao/deepseek-harness-remote)
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 DSH Remote contributors

  The phone link code in DS Bot's link/ (here godbot/link/) adapts code from
  commit 4d888ad of DSH Remote. DS Bot changed the names, the Noise prologue
  label, the fragment marker, the hello and the pairing, so the protocol is DS
  Bot's own and does not talk to DSH Remote.
  - link/noise.ts adapts packages/crypto/src/noise.ts (the Noise IK session and
    the remote-key check).
  - link/keys.ts copies the key pair, fingerprint and Base64URL functions of
    packages/crypto/src/index.ts.
  - link/frames.ts adapts packages/protocol/src/index.ts: the control frame and
    message envelopes, the frame size limits, and SecureMessageCodec. It checks
    frames by hand instead of with zod.
  - link/transport.ts copies packages/webrtc/src/transport.ts and
    packages/webrtc/src/websocket-backpressure.ts.
  - link/relay-transport.ts adapts RelayTransport in packages/webrtc/src/index.ts.
  - link/secure-transport.ts adapts apps/android/src/services/secure-transport.ts.
  - link/rpc-client.ts adapts RemoteClientCore in packages/client-core/src/index.ts.
  - link/host.ts follows the flow of HostServerConnection in
    packages/plugin/src/server-connection.ts (reconnect, connect.incoming, the
    responder handshake, Relay sends), written again for DS Bot.
  - src/polyfills.ts copies apps/android/src/polyfills.ts.

